WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.112
Brad: Now I understand why they call a tall building a skyscraper!

2
00:00:08.113 --> 00:00:11.498
I can’t even see the top of this one. Danny:

3
00:00:11.499 --> 00:00:17.524
Everything is so gray, you almost can’t see anything. Tina:

4
00:00:17.525 --> 00:00:20.538
So how do we find Hopian? Danny:

5
00:00:20.539 --> 00:00:23.424
I . . . don’t know. Brad:

6
00:00:23.425 --> 00:00:28.764
You mean, we came all this way, and you don’t know how to find him? Danny:

7
00:00:28.765 --> 00:00:31.709
I thought he’d be waiting for us. Tina:

8
00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.862
Well, he’s not. Danny:

9
00:00:33.863 --> 00:00:36.991
I’m sure we’ll figure something out. Brad:

10
00:00:36.992 --> 00:00:40.359
Look! Do you see what I see?

11
00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:42.400
Tina: I’m not sure.

12
00:00:42.401 --> 00:00:43.860
Brad: It’s a giant!

13
00:00:43.861 --> 00:00:45.575
Near that car.

14
00:00:45.576 --> 00:00:52.255
Danny: I see him!

15
00:00:52.256 --> 00:00:55.433
Tina: Let’s go over and talk to him!

16
00:00:55.434 --> 00:01:02.430
Brad: Yeah! Maybe he knows where Hopian is.

17
00:01:02.431 --> 00:01:05.635
Danny: Hi. My name is Danny.

18
00:01:05.636 --> 00:01:09.902
We’re . . . um . . . we’re looking for a friend.

19
00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:14.431
He’s a giant like you. Tina:

20
00:01:14.432 --> 00:01:16.847
His name is Hopian. Brad:

21
00:01:16.848 --> 00:01:26.798
Do you know him? Tina:

22
00:01:26.799 --> 00:01:29.943
Oh no! Don’t cry. Danny:

23
00:01:29.944 --> 00:01:32.377
Did we say something bad? Brad:

24
00:01:32.378 --> 00:01:35.679
I think he was hoping for red paint. Tina:

25
00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:37.648
It’s okay, Mr. Giant. Just

26
00:01:37.649 --> 00:01:48.985
tell us where Hopian is. Danny:

27
00:01:48.986 --> 00:01:55.038
Remember, Hopian said that without color all the giants were getting sad. Brad:

28
00:01:55.039 --> 00:01:58.494
Well, I don’t think he’s going to be much help. Tina:

29
00:01:58.495 --> 00:02:07.388
I think we should leave him alone. Brad:

30
00:02:07.389 --> 00:02:09.577
What is it? Tina:

31
00:02:09.578 --> 00:02:11.208
I don’t know. I

32
00:02:11.209 --> 00:02:14.218
had a funny feeling. Danny:

33
00:02:14.219 --> 00:02:18.158
Well, something funny would be nice right now. Tina:

34
00:02:18.159 --> 00:02:23.279
Look! That’s not funny, but it sure is weird.

35
00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:26.563
Danny: What’s so weird?

36
00:02:26.564 --> 00:02:29.338
Tina: I see something red.

37
00:02:29.339 --> 00:02:35.553
Brad: Maybe it means we should stop.

38
00:02:35.554 --> 00:02:38.787
Tina: It just became a stop sign!

39
00:02:38.788 --> 00:02:40.845
Danny: Can it hear us?

40
00:02:40.846 --> 00:02:42.726
Brad: Let’s find out.

41
00:02:42.727 --> 00:02:47.693
Can you hear us?

42
00:02:47.694 --> 00:02:56.786
Tina: It can! Do you know Hopian?

43
00:02:56.787 --> 00:02:58.973
Danny: It does!

44
00:02:58.974 --> 00:03:04.923
Brad: Can you take us to Hopian?

45
00:03:04.924 --> 00:03:06.899
Danny: What does that mean?

46
00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:14.145
Tina: I think it means we’re supposed to follow it.

47
00:03:14.146 --> 00:03:18.949
Danny: I told you this wouldn’t be difficult.

